WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.203
Hey, did you get a chance to look at the little cafe near the station? I was thinking we could go there on Saturday.

00:00:06.553 --> 00:00:14.035
I walked past it yesterday. It looks nice, but Saturday morning is a bit difficult. I promised to help my sister move.

00:00:14.385 --> 00:00:21.019
Oh, right. How about Sunday instead? We could have lunch first, then take a walk by the river if the weather is good.

00:00:21.369 --> 00:00:29.185
Sunday works for me. Actually, I would rather meet a little later. Is one thirty okay? I don't want to rush in the morning.

00:00:29.535 --> 00:00:35.364
Sure. Let's meet outside the station at one thirty. Do you know if the cafe has vegetarian food?

00:00:35.714 --> 00:00:42.654
Their menu had a mushroom sandwich and a tomato soup. I'll check whether we need a reservation, and send you the address tonight.

00:00:43.004 --> 00:00:50.537
Perfect, thanks. And if it rains, we can skip the walk and visit that bookstore next door. I've been meaning to go there for ages.

00:00:50.887 --> 00:00:57.328
That sounds like a good backup plan. I'll bring the book I borrowed from you, too. See you on Sunday!
